hpc:ReservationDelete a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Reservation ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "delete a reservation" .

hpc:ReservationDeleteResult a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf owl:Thing .

hpc:ReservationDeleteResultDescription a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:ReservationDeleteResult ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .
```

This ontology fragment represents a `ReservationDelete` object property that deletes a reservation, and a `ReservationDeleteResult` class that represents the result of the deletion operation. The `ReservationDeleteResultDescription` datatype property is used to describe the result.
